The present petition under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 (Cr.P.C.
) has been filed by the petitioner seeking quashing and setting aside of orders dated 07.11.2023 an d 08.12.2023, passed by learned Metropolitan Magistrate-03, South District, Saket Courts, Delhi, in Case titled as State Vs. Shaheen Khan , arising out of FIR No. 505/2021, registered at Police Station Mehrauli, for offences punishable under Sections 498A/406/34 of the Indian Penal Code,
1860 (IPC ).

